!include ../_style.puml

title YouTube 上傳（Video.youtubeUpload）狀態機圖

[*] --> uploading : autoUploadVideoToYouTube\n[processing 已 completed 且尚無 youtubeVideoId]\n／以 CAS 條件搶佔 claim，記錄 attemptCount
uploading --> uploaded : 上傳 API 成功\n／寫入 youtubeVideoId、videoUrl，清除 error
uploading --> failed : 本地檔案遺失，或上傳 API 失敗\n／記錄 error、retrySafe 與 nextRetryAt
failed --> uploading : scheduleYouTubeUploadRetry（人工）\n或背景重試排程\n[retrySafe == true 且 attemptCount < youtubeUploadMaxAttempts]
uploading --> failed : recoverPendingYouTubeUploads 逾時偵測\n[lastAttemptAt 早於 youtubeUploadStuckAfterMs]\n／標記 retrySafe=false（隔離，避免重複上傳）
failed --> [*] : 不可再重試\n[retrySafe == false 或 attemptCount >= youtubeUploadMaxAttempts]\n（需人工於 YouTube Studio 確認後才可能繼續）
uploaded --> [*]

note right of failed
  對應設計類別：Video（youtubeUpload 子文件）。
  assertRetryableUpload 另以 YOUTUBE_UPLOAD_ALREADY_COMPLETED／
  YOUTUBE_UPLOAD_RETRY_NOT_ALLOWED／YOUTUBE_UPLOAD_RETRY_UNSAFE／
  YOUTUBE_UPLOAD_RETRY_LIMIT_REACHED 明確拒絕不合法的手動重試請求。
end note

@enduml
